00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:54.790
share my knowledge of the industry,

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.253
help them learn to do-
- Yeah. Mentorship.

00:12:56.253 --> 00:12:57.951
- What they really wanna do.

00:12:57.951 --> 00:13:00.560
And it's exciting to
be able to mentor them.

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:01.660
- That's really cool.
- Yeah.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:02.493
- Helping them get

00:13:02.493 --> 00:13:03.342
where you were.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:13:03.342 --> 00:13:05.270
- Yeah, yeah, yeah. That's
awesome. That's awesome.

